 Sky←SkyAt ARGS;STATEDDAYNO;STATEDTIME;LAT;LONG;TIME;DATE
⍝ Positions of stars, sun, moon, planets and comet for one observation
⍝ ARGS is STATEDDAYNO STATEDTIME LAT LONG: Julian day number of the
⍝ stated date, stated time (UTC hours), latitude and longitude (degrees
⍝ north and east). Sky holds the inputs and every calculated position.
